  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training school for Afro-descendent leaders in economic, social and cultural rights</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ashanti Per Red Peruana de Jvenes Afrodescendientes (Ashanti Peru), in partnership with Asociacin Negra de Defensa y Promocin de los Derechos Humanos (ASONEDH), will develop the capabilities of 60 young Afro-Peruvians to advocate for inclusive public policies. It will also carry out activities aimed at strengthening the cultural identity of an additional 750 youths from poor districts of Lima and forming networks aimed at sustaining the project&apos;s goals and objectives.</narrative>
  </description>
